  "details": "Per the SteamVR bindings, my Quest 2 controller should only activate the Action Menu, when pressing the B button on the right controller. It opens like normal, but when I close the Action Menu, the Quick Menu subsequently appears in my right hand.\n\nBefore this beta, I only had my QM only set to my left hand using the Y button.\n\nUsing Steam Link.",
